    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-09.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Ghost of Adventurer: It's your loss, not mine.",
   "header": "Ghost of Adventurer",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-11.html": {
   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-11.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Ghost of Adventurer: Ok. Then, let's talk about the method. First, take this jewelry. If you hit the well, the spirits will come out. While you are fighting with the spirits, I will break the seal of the hidden report in the well Just, don't kill the spirit while I'm working. Because they will come…",
   "header": "Ghost of Adventurer",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "10"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I am not sure\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest 31529-13.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest",
     "event": "31529-13.html",
     "quest": 22,
     "to": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-13.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I see\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest 31529-13a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest",
     "event": "31529-13a.html",
     "quest": 22,
     "to": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-13a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-13.html": {
   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31529-13.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Ghost of Adventurer: What don't you get? Fight with them, don't kill them. When the jewelry changes color, find me. Don't kill the spirits before the jewelry changes color!",
   "header": "Ghost of Adventurer",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
